  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_StudyAsOaksAide",
      "en_US": [
        "I study Pokémon as Prof. Oak’s\n",
        "Aide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsAuthorityOnMons",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak may not look like much,\n",
        "but he’s the authority on Pokémon.\r",
        "Many Pokémon Trainers hold him in\n",
        "high regard."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakWhichOneWillYouChoose",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Now, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "Check a Poké Ball on the shelf\n",
        "and choose your type."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGrampsIsntAround",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: What, it’s only {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}?\n",
        "Gramps isn’t around."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_BlankEncyclopedia",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s like an encyclopedia, but the\n",
        "pages are blank."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations, Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Prof. Oak put me in charge of\n",
        "keeping track of everything a Gym\f",
        "Leader can do.\r",
        "There’s a lot! Ask me about any of\n",
        "it, anytime."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_EmailMessage",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s an e-mail message here.\r",
        "…\r",
        "Finally!\n",
        "The ultimate Trainers of the\f",
        "Pokémon League are ready to\f",
        "take on all comers!\r",
        "Bring your best Pokémon and see\n",
        "how you rate as a Trainer!\r",
        "Pokémon League Hq\n",
        "Indigo Plateau\r",
        "Prof. Oak, please visit us!\n",
        "…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu",
      "en_US": "Press Start to open the Menu!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_SaveOptionInMenu",
      "en_US": [
        "The Save option is on the Menu.\n",
        "Use it regularly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ThoseArePokeBalls",
      "en_US": [
        "A shelf packed with Poké Balls.\n",
        "They hold Pokémon of every type!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHeyDontGoAwayYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Hey!\n",
        "Don’t go away yet!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalFedUpWithWaiting",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Gramps!\n",
        "I’m fed up with waiting!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThreeMonsChooseOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}?\n",
        "Let me think…\r",
        "Oh, that’s right, I told you to\n",
        "come! Just wait!\r",
        "I have big news for you both.\r",
        "So many Trainers reach the\n",
        "Pokémon League these days…\r",
        "…that the Elite Four never get\n",
        "a single day off!\r",
        "So the League is adding a ninth\n",
        "Gym to the League Challenge…\r",
        "…right here in Pallet Town!\r",
        "They asked me to find its\n",
        "Gym Leader.\r",
        "And I’ve chosen you two as my\n",
        "candidates!\r",
        "Now, League rules say a Gym\n",
        "Leader uses Pokémon of just one\f",
        "primary type.\r",
        "So you’ll take on the League that\n",
        "way, too.\r",
        "Every Gym Leader, every battle\n",
        "with your rival, and the Elite\f",
        "Four: one type only!\r",
        "And no two of the same Pokémon\n",
        "on your team, either.\r",
        "If you both make it through, you\n",
        "two will battle one last time.\r",
        "The winner gets the Gym!\r",
        "These Poké Balls can give you a\n",
        "Pokémon of any type.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, you go first.\n",
        "Pick the type you’ll build your\f",
        "Gym around.\r",
        "I’ve ordered my list by how strong\n",
        "a team each type can put together.\r",
        "The types at the top have mighty\n",
        "Pokémon to choose from.\r",
        "The ones near the bottom… Well,\n",
        "they’re for trainers who want\f",
        "a real challenge!\r",
        "Once you’ve chosen, there’s no\n",
        "going back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalNoFairWhatAboutMe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey! Gramps! No fair!\n",
        "What about me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBePatientRival",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Be patient, {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}.\n",
        "You can have one, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsGoingToHaveRadioShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak is going to have his own\n",
        "radio show soon.\r",
        "The program will be called Prof.\n",
        "Oak’s Pokémon Seminar."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DaisyWillGroomMons",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I bet you’ve become\n",
        "good friends with your Pokémon.\r",
        "By the way, did you know about\n",
        "Daisy?\r",
        "If you show Daisy your Pokémon,\n",
        "she can tell how much it likes you.\r",
        "Occasionally, she will even groom\n",
        "a Pokémon for you.\r",
        "This is a secret, so please don’t\n",
        "tell anyone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymRooms_Text_OakCaughtSoMany",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Let me see your\n",
        "Pokédex…\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "caught! Splendid work!\r",
        "A Trainer who’s met so many\n",
        "Pokémon deserves a place to\f",
        "show off their memories."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymRooms_Text_OakRightRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "So I’ve had one more room built\n",
        "onto your Gym, through its right\f",
        "wall.\r",
        "That’s every wall I can knock\n",
        "through, I’m afraid! Ho ho!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_OakQuizRules",
      "en_US": "Oak: Here we go!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizE1",
      "en_US": [
        "Which type takes no damage at\n",
        "all from Electric moves?"
