    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCustomBallIOrdered",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! \n",
        "It’s the custom Poké Ball!\r",
        "I had it on order.\n",
        "Thank you!\r",
        "…Hm? A letter came with it.\n",
        "Why, it’s from {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I wrote about you and your Gym\n",
        "plans. A reply already! It says…\r",
        "“Coming to Pallet Town to meet\n",
        "your candidate.” Today?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGramps",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Gramps!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalWhatDidYouCallMeFor",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: I almost forgot!\n",
        "What did you call me for?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveRequestForYouTwo",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Oh, right! Now that you’re\n",
        "both here… about that Gym."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakPokedexOnDesk",
      "en_US": [
        "A Gym Leader faces challengers with\n",
        "all kinds of Pokémon.\r",
        "A Leader who doesn’t know their\n",
        "opponents won’t last a week!\r",
        "So on the desk is my invention,\n",
        "the Pokédex!\r",
        "It records data on every Pokémon\n",
        "you see or catch. A Leader’s best\f",
        "scouting tool!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTakeTheseWithYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} and {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}.\n",
        "Take these with you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedPokedexFromOak",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the Pokédex\n",
        "from Prof. Oak."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCatchMonsForDataTakeThese",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Seeing a Pokémon tells you\n",
        "a little. Catching one tells you\f",
        "everything.\r",
        "And a Leader needs a full team of\n",
        "their type, too!\r",
        "So, here are some tools for\n",
        "catching wild Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedFivePokeBalls",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received five Poké Balls."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakExplainCatching",
      "en_US": [
        "When a wild Pokémon appears,\n",
        "it’s fair game.\r",
        "Just throw a Poké Ball at it and\n",
        "try to catch it!\r",
        "This won’t always work, however.\r",
        "A healthy Pokémon can escape.\n",
        "You have to be lucky!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCompleteMonGuideWasMyDream",
      "en_US": [
        "Filling the Pokédex was my dream,\n",
        "once. A complete guide to every\f",
        "Pokémon…\r",
        "But these days, I’d settle for a\n",
        "fine Gym Leader in Pallet Town.\r",
        "So the Gym comes first! Fill your\n",
        "Pokédex along the way, and you’ll\f",
        "know any challenger’s team.\r",
        "Now get moving, you two!\n",
        "The League is waiting!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLeaveItToMeGramps",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Leave it to me, Gramps!\n",
        "I’ll win the Gym and fill the\f",
        "Pokédex!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalTellSisNotToGiveYouMap",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, you might as well give\n",
        "up now. That Gym is mine.\r",
        "I know! I’ll borrow a Town Map\n",
        "from my sis!\r",
        "I’ll tell her not to lend you one,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Hahaha!\r",
        "Don’t bother coming around to\n",
        "my place after this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBattleMonForItToGrow",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, raise your young\n",
        "Pokémon by making it battle.\r",
        "It has to battle for it to grow."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCanReachNextTownWithMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: If a wild Pokémon appears,\n",
        "your Pokémon can battle it.\r",
        "With it at your side, you should be\n",
        "able to reach the next town."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalMyMonLooksTougher",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: My Pokémon looks a lot\n",
        "tougher than yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoChoosePlayer",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Heh, I don’t need to be\n",
        "greedy like you. I’m mature!\r",
        "Go ahead and choose, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Again",
      "en_US": "Hello again, Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
    },
