    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakConfirmType",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} type!\n",
        "Then your partner is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Remember, your Gym will only use\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type Pokémon.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "your final choice?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLetsCheckOutMons",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Wait, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Let’s check out our Pokémon!\r",
        "Come on, I’ll take you on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakSightingsOfRareMons",
      "en_US": [
        "Recently, there have been sightings\n",
        "of many rare Pokémon species.\r",
        "I’m talking about Pokémon that\n",
        "have never been seen in Kanto.\r",
        "I would love to go see things for\n",
        "myself, but I’m much too old.\r",
        "Since I can’t do it, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, I’d\n",
        "like you to go in my place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalJustLetMeHandleEverything",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey, I heard that!\r",
        "Gramps, what’s with favoring\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} over me all the time?\r",
        "I went and collected more Pokémon,\n",
        "and faster, too.\r",
        "You should just let me handle\n",
        "everything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNeedYourHelpTooNeedToSeePokedexes",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: I know, I know.\n",
        "Of course I need your help, too.\r",
        "Now, I need to see both your\n",
        "PokédexES."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTookBothPokedexUnits",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak took both Pokédex\n",
        "units."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNowTheseUnitsCanRecordMoreData",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …  … … …\r",
        "… … …  … … …\r",
        "…And that’s done!\r",
        "Now these units can record data on\n",
        "a lot more Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PlayersPokedexWasUpgraded",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}’s Pokédex was upgraded!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMustReallyWorkToFillPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} and {STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}!\r",
        "This time, you really must work\n",
        "towards filling your PokédexES.\r",
        "I urge you to make them the best\n",
        "and the most complete of all time!\r",
        "Truly, this is a monumentally great\n",
        "undertaking in Pokémon history!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllCompleteThePokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Gramps, calm down.\n",
        "Don’t get so excited.\r",
        "I’ll get the Pokédex completed,\n",
        "don’t you worry about a thing.\r",
        "I think I’ll try looking around\n",
        "One Island first…\r",
        "Anyways, I’m outta here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymRooms_Text_OakBackRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "So I’ve had a room built onto your\n",
        "Gym, behind its back wall.\r",
        "It’s a little smaller than the Gym,\n",
        "but it has a PC of its own.\r",
        "Decorate it any way you like! Your\n",
        "trophies would look grand in there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymRooms_Text_OakLeftRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "So I’ve had another room built\n",
        "onto your Gym, through its left\f",
        "wall.\r",
        "Make it whatever you like. A room\n",
        "for your favorite type, perhaps?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymRooms_Text_DoorwayOpened",
      "en_US": [
        "A new doorway opened in\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}’s Gym!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymRooms_Text_OakShowItOff",
      "en_US": [
        "Every room shares the Gym’s\n",
        "storage, so decorate away!\r",
        "Each one has its own floors and\n",
        "walls, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_OakPikachuOffer",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! A master of\n",
        "Electric types now!\r",
        "A Pikachu here at the lab has\n",
        "been watching you on TV. It’s a\r",
        "strong one, and very picky.\r",
        "It will only go with a trainer\n",
        "who really knows its type. Will\r",
        "you take my quiz? Five\n",
        "questions, all of them right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_OakEeveeOffer",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! A master of\n",
        "Normal types now!\r",
        "An Eevee here at the lab has\n",
        "been watching you on TV. It’s a\r",
        "strong one, and very picky.\r",
        "It will only go with a trainer\n",
        "who really knows its type. Will\r",
        "you take my quiz? Five\n",
        "questions, all of them right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_OakQuizLater",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ho ho! Any time you’re\n",
        "ready, then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizN1",
      "en_US": [
        "Which type takes no damage at\n",
        "all from Normal moves?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsRock",
      "en_US": "Rock"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsGhost",
      "en_US": "Ghost"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsPsychic",
      "en_US": "Psychic"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizN2",
      "en_US": [
        "Normal-type Pokémon are weak to\n",
        "which type?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsFighting",
      "en_US": "Fighting"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsDark",
      "en_US": "Dark"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizN3",
      "en_US": [
        "Normal moves are not very\n",
        "effective against which type?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizN4",
      "en_US": [
        "Which ability turns Normal moves\n",
        "into Fairy moves?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsRefrigerate",
      "en_US": "Refrigerate"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsPixilate",
      "en_US": "Pixilate"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsAerilate",
      "en_US": "Aerilate"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizN5",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Normal move always strikes\n",
        "first?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsHyperBeam",
      "en_US": "Hyper Beam"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsBodySlam",
      "en_US": "Body Slam"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_AnsQuickAttack",
      "en_US": "Quick Attack"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_QuizPassed",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Five out of five! Splendid!\r",
        "There’s no doubt about it. You\n",
        "and this Pokémon belong\r",
        "together."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_EventMons_Text_OakPartnerAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: It’s chosen you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\n",
        "Raise it with all the care\r",
        "you’ve given your gym!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymSwitch_Text_LabGymCharm",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Your mentor left this\n",
        "for you. A Gym Charm!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymSwitch_Text_LabGymCharmHow",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Shiny Pokémon of your Gym’s\n",
        "type will turn up far more often.\r",
        "If your Gym changes type, the charm\n",
        "changes with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymSwitch_Text_LabGoal",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: How’s your Gym, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}?\r",
        "Win {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} in a row there, and\n",
        "you’ll have mastered {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} type.\r",
        "Then I’ll have a new challenge\n",
        "for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymSwitch_Text_LabMidStreak",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} wins in a\n",
        "row and counting, I hear!\r",
        "Let’s talk about your Gym’s type\n",
        "once your streak is over."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymSwitch_Text_LabMidStreakMastered",
      "en_US": [
        "Win or lose, I’ll come by your\n",
        "Gym when it ends!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymSwitch_Text_LabOffer",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Have you changed\n",
        "your mind?\r",
        "You’ve earned a new type for your\n",
        "Gym. Would you like to choose it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PokedexRating_Text_Wroooaaarrr",
      "en_US": "Wroooooooaaaaaarrrr!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymCandidate_Text_OakAside1",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! I hear a Gym\n",
        "Leader has approved of you.\r",
        "Good, good… I picked out that Gym’s\n",
        "floor tiles myself, you know."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymCandidate_Text_OakAside2",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Several approvals already!\n",
        "My, my.\r",
        "You know, I was quite the Trainer\n",
        "in my day.\r",
        "…But never mind that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymCandidate_Text_OakAside3",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Hm? Oh, I was just at the\n",
        "Gym. Checking the lights.\r",
        "It’s a fine Gym. Very fine…\n",
        "Ahem! Now, your Pokédex."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymCandidate_Text_MentorAtDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hello? Prof. Oak?\n",
        "Is your candidate here?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymCandidate_Text_OakWelcomesMentor",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You came all\n",
        "this way!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, this is the one I wrote\n",
        "to about you. Go on, say hello!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_GymCandidate_Text_OakAfterMentor",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: My, my! One letter, and\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} comes all this way!\r",
        "A fine mentor for you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\n",
        "Yes… I’m sure of it. Mostly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Challengers",
      "en_US": [
        "Talk to the Aide in your Gym when\n",
        "you’re ready to take challengers.\r",
        "They keep coming, one after\n",
        "another, until one beats you.\r",
        "Every win pays prize money, and\n",
        "challengers often leave a gift.\f",
        "Your best streak is recorded.\r",
        "Anyone who beats you earns your\n",
        "Badge, and their name goes on\f",
        "your Gym’s statue.\r",
        "Your Gym’s PC sells decorations\n",
        "and practice trainers. Battles\f",
        "happen on your Battle Stage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Convention",
      "en_US": [
        "Every year, the Johto League holds\n",
        "the Gym Leader Convention in\f",
        "Goldenrod City’s Radio Tower.\r",
        "Your invitation comes to your Gym.\n",
        "Show it to the sailor at\f",
        "Vermilion’s harbor, and the ferry\f",
        "takes you to Olivine City.\r",
        "Gym Leaders, Elite Four and\n",
        "Champions from every region battle\f",
        "there, in a hall for every type.\r",
        "Beat everyone in a hall to win its\n",
        "trophy for your Gym. Your Pokémon\f",
        "are healed after every battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Safari",
      "en_US": [
        "The Exotic Pokémon Safari is the\n",
        "second door of Fuchsia City’s\f",
        "Safari Zone building.\r",
        "Its attendant sells Gym Leaders an\n",
        "Exotic Pass. It’s ¥10,000, and you\f",
        "only need the one.\r",
        "Every region has its own zone,\n",
        "from Johto to Paldea. Battles there\f",
        "are normal ones: use your own\f",
        "Poké Balls.\r",
        "The kiosks sell supplies, and the\n",
        "evolution items you’ve found.\r",
        "And some zones have legendaries,\n",
        "hidden behind puzzles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_NewPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Until now, Pokémon from far-off\n",
        "regions were out of reach.\r",
        "But a Gym Leader can go anywhere!\n",
        "Every Pokémon there is can be\f",
        "yours now.\r",
        "Johto’s live on the routes around\n",
        "the Convention, and every region’s\f",
        "live in the Exotic Safari in\f",
        "Fuchsia City.\r",
        "Try to catch them all!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Mastery",
      "en_US": [
        "Win 15 battles in a row in your\n",
        "Gym, and you’ve mastered its type.\f",
        "After the first type, it’s 10.\r",
        "The last challenger of the streak\n",
        "is your mentor, with their full\f",
        "Convention team. Beat them!\r",
        "When the streak ends, Prof. Oak\n",
        "comes to your Gym and offers you a\f",
        "new type. Your Badge changes too.\r",
        "In his lab, Prof. Oak can switch\n",
        "your Gym back to any type it’s\f",
        "had, free."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Rooms",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak has a room built onto\n",
        "your Gym for every 100 kinds of\f",
        "Pokémon you catch.\r",
        "Show him 100, 200 and 300 kinds,\n",
        "here in his lab. Each opens a new\f",
        "doorway in your Gym.\r",
        "The first is in the back wall,\n",
        "then the left wall, then the\f",
        "right.\r",
        "Each room has its own PC, floors\n",
        "and walls. The decorations come\f",
        "from your Gym’s storage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Legends",
      "en_US": [
        "Every type has its own legendary\n",
        "Pokémon. It comes to your Gym the\f",
        "first time your Gym is that type.\r",
        "If it gets away, it hides deep in\n",
        "Cerulean Cave. Keep looking!\r",
        "And the Gym Charm from your mentor\n",
        "makes Shiny Pokémon of your Gym’s\f",
        "type turn up far more often."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Penny",
      "en_US": [
        "Penny lives in the house by\n",
        "Viridian City’s flower garden.\r",
        "She knows how Eevee can become a\n",
        "Pokémon of any type.\r",
        "Now that your Gym’s official, bring\n",
        "her another Eevee, and she’ll give\f",
        "you the item for another type."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Costumes",
      "en_US": [
        "The Costume Maker on the 2nd floor\n",
        "of Celadon Condominiums has been\f",
        "waiting for a Gym Leader.\r",
        "She has a Pikachu that loves\n",
        "dressing up, and five costumes\f",
        "for it to earn. Pay her a visit!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_LeaderAide_Text_Tutors",
      "en_US": [
        "The Leader Academy’s type masters\n",
        "are still around Kanto: one for\f",
        "each type, and two for Normal.\r",
        "Each sets a trial. Pass it, and\n",
        "they’ll teach your Pokémon any of\f",
        "their type’s moves, as often as\f",
        "you like.\r",
        "You’ll know them by their type’s\n",
        "colours. The board in the\f",
        "Academy’s main hall keeps count."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_HardType",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ho! The {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} type?\n",
        "That’s a bold choice!\r",
        "There aren’t many strong {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "Pokémon. Every battle will be\f",
        "a real test of your skill."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThisMonIsEnergetic",
      "en_US": [
        "This Pokémon is really quite\n",
        "energetic!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedMonFromOak",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "from Prof. Oak!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_gText_NicknameThisPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
